"align: center;\">The perfect beginning to your Alpine day.</small>"
msgstr ""
"<small class=\"text-muted\" style=\"text-align: center;"
"\">ອີ່ມໜຳສຳລານກັບອາຫານເຊົ້າທຸກໆເຊົ້າ.</small><small class=\"text-muted\" "
